#119: FILE: kernel/cgroup.c:2186:
+			if (retval = css_set_prefetch(cgrp, oldcg, &newcg_list))

Do not use assignments in if condition.
Example::

  if ((foo = bar(...)) < BAZ) {

should be written as::

  foo = bar(...);
  if (foo < BAZ) {

